1
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,000
The Mistletoe Inn is a drama, tv movie, romance film directed by Alex Wright.

2
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:30,000
When aspiring romance novelist Kim Rossi is unceremoniously dumped by her
soon-to-be-published romance novelist boyfriend, Kim takes stock and decides to take a leap.

3
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:42,000
She signs up for a romance writing retreat at a quaint Vermont Inn shortly before Christmas, where a
top romance novelist is scheduled to attend and read the work of one lucky writer.

4
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Shortly after arriving, she crosses paths with Zeke, whom she initially finds to
be intrusive and, naturally, ends up being her assignment partner.

5
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Worse yet, her ex is also at the retreat.

6
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:18,000
Despite these bumps in the road, Kim steps outside her comfort zone and
plunges into the writing exercises, surprising herself.

7
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:30,000
Equally unexpected is the attraction that seems to be building between her and Zeke
that promises to take her down a road she never imagined traveling.

8
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,000
Based on the book by Richard Paul Evans.

9
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:54,000
Kim, played by Alicia Witt.

10
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Zeke, played by David Alpay.

11
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:18,000
Garth, played by Casey Manderson.

12
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
Samantha, played by Lucie Guest.

13
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:42,000
Robert, played by Linden Banks.

14
00:58:48,000 --> 00:58:54,000
Luanne, played by Tiffani Timms.

15
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Jill Suzanne Wagner (born January 13, 1979) is an
American actress and television personality.

16
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
She was the on-field host for the ABC game show Wipeout from 2008 to 2011 and again
from 2013 to 2014, briefly leaving during the fifth season in 2012.

17
01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:30,000
Since then, Wagner has starred in several made-for-television films for the
Hallmark Channel, Hallmark Movies & Mysteries, and Great American Family.

18
01:15:36,000 --> 01:15:42,000
She stars as Bobby in the Paramount+ spy series Special Ops: Lioness (2023).

19
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:54,000
The tone is emotional.
